<figure class="context-distribution-diagram" aria-labelledby="context-distribution-caption">
  <div class="context-distribution-diagram__panels">
    <section class="context-distribution-diagram__panel">
      <header><span>Without Context</span><strong>Pass the value through</strong></header>
      <ol>
        <li><b>App</b><code>user</code></li>
        <li><b>Layout</b><code>user</code></li>
        <li><b>Sidebar</b><code>user</code></li>
        <li><b>Profile</b><em>uses user</em></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="context-distribution-diagram__panel context-distribution-diagram__panel--context">
      <header><span>With Context</span><strong>Provide where it is needed</strong></header>
      <ol>
        <li><b>App</b><code>provides user</code></li>
        <li><b>Layout</b><i>does not need it</i></li>
        <li><b>Sidebar</b><i>does not need it</i></li>
        <li><b>Profile</b><em>reads user</em></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="context-distribution-caption">
    Context removes forwarding work. It does not own the value or its update rules.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
